TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bugün UZUN süre böyle karanlık kalacak,
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Cadılar Bayramı{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
gibi ama korkunç kostümler yok, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Le soleil est en grève aujourd'hui.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:002C:}}Il en a assez que je lui fasse
concurrence !

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Oggi il sole non sorgerà!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Sai cosa significa?
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Che l'unica a splendere sarò io!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Wait a sec? {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}What time is it?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ohmigosh! I have no idea!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Ack! Too much darkness! {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}I feel like
I'm floating in space, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}This night has been going on, like,
forever and ever. {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Am I sleepy?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Am I awake? {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}I don't know!

{{TAG:0003:0027:}}OK, look down...{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Look around...{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
It's been so dark today...{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I'm scared I'll fall into holes!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}A ver, una pata...{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} ahora la otra...{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
¡Ay, hola!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} {{TAG:0003:0009:}}¡Como no veo nada,
tengo miedo de caerme en un hoyo!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}OK, guarda in su...{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} guarda in giù...{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Dai un bacio a chi vuoi tu...{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ma occhio a non cadere: è così buio!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Tamam, aşağı bak...{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Etrafına bak...{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Bugün o kadar karanlık ki...{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Çukura düşeceğim diye korkuyorum!
